<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Doris 字数助手 is deliberately NOT sandboxed: the App Sandbox blocks
     reading other apps' text through Accessibility, which is all this
     helper does. It needs no other entitlement — it talks to Doris through
     files in ~/.doris/ipc/typing (see TypingWire). Allowed for Developer ID
     distribution; the App Store would not accept it. -->
